Dear fellow nethack/slashem/spork/whaterver server owner.

Last weekend my server got into the difficult situation of beeing
missused through a missconfiguration.
This missconfiguration can be used so that the server works as a SOCKS
proxy, meaning that every kind of tcp traffic could be tunneld through
your server including illegal content!
You can disable this by adding the following line to your sshd_config:

AllowTcpForwarding no

or check the ssh manual for disableing the tunneling support for your
dgamelaunch user.

If this is actually a feature of your server or if "it works as
designed" then you can ignore this message.

This message will be published in rec.games.roguelike.nethack latest in
7 days (1st of June 2009) from now on, for all the nethacklike admins
that i didn't get through this mail. So please change your server
setting until then.

Best regards
Friedrich owner of slashem.de


